{"versions":[{"path":"versions/2eb0c50a-f3a7-49b1-90e5-5405038029a6/4f3a8cd56d6a1fe8445edce272df2b47e63a0c22de63bea46b151b4019e09167.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"2eb0c50a-f3a7-49b1-90e5-5405038029a6","revision":"sha256:4f3a8cd56d6a1fe8445edce272df2b47e63a0c22de63bea46b151b4019e09167","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"If sorting can be done in O(n) time, then we can implement the Huffman's algorithm so that it runs in O(n) time."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":true,"option_id":"7f1babcd-6e54-4065-b1bd-36365804a013"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":false,"option_id":"300d2514-6347-42a7-a485-f9d604400db2"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"按非负权重处理, 排序后用两个队列分别保存原始权重与已合并权重, 每次从队首取两个最小项并合并, 共 n-1 次, 合并成本 O(n). 若排序也是 O(n), 总时间为 O(n)"}]}}},{"path":"versions/5be0ab68-1e9d-4dc4-abbc-ea0494977b53/b0682c9bbd723e27024da826c61e19977daef640d900334034d4fab350d5279c.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"5be0ab68-1e9d-4dc4-abbc-ea0494977b53","revision":"sha256:b0682c9bbd723e27024da826c61e19977daef640d900334034d4fab350d5279c","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"If the depth of an AVL tree with nodes { 1, 2, 3, 4 } is 3 (the depth of the root is 1), then it is possible for node 4 to be the root."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"cc724962-2153-4ad1-9e7e-8ad7a39e5a38"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"d429813d-7653-40ba-8254-9f7f0bb788a1"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"如果 4 为根, 其他三个结点都在左子树, 右子树为空. 左子树高度至少为 2, 两侧高度差至少为 2, 不满足 AVL 条件"}]}}},{"path":"versions/71ea0ced-cc1d-4670-8649-5c8dbdc8c90f/2a9b55b85729bb263a1363083d578bf1364f40d987e75a4cfe9391ef3feea1e6.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"71ea0ced-cc1d-4670-8649-5c8dbdc8c90f","revision":"sha256:2a9b55b85729bb263a1363083d578bf1364f40d987e75a4cfe9391ef3feea1e6","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"In an AVL tree, it is impossible to have this situation that the balance factors of a node and both of its children are all +1."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"1afa7f52-ae6c-4e19-b684-4634b889b81b"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"74088b07-8ae6-42d7-a1ea-b092a6fa69e8"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"反例: 根为 5, 左孩子 3 的孩子为 2、4, 2 的左孩子为 1; 右孩子 7 的左孩子为 6. 按左高减右高计算, 5、3、7 的平衡因子均为 +1, 整棵树仍是 AVL 树"}]}}},{"path":"versions/ac08292d-f206-4964-9f6b-428e63ce7d56/0b75c5d5b92204d7737d980a04a2d5a68fecfc1df82c64b8555d00870588af52.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"ac08292d-f206-4964-9f6b-428e63ce7d56","revision":"sha256:0b75c5d5b92204d7737d980a04a2d5a68fecfc1df82c64b8555d00870588af52","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Insert { 1, 2, 5, 3, 8, 4, -7, 10, 88, 34, 15, 63, 18, -18, 96 } into an initially empty binomial queue, the resulting roots are 96, -18, -7 and 1."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"bba58fb0-bab0-49ee-9ce0-1181d17d18b3"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"9b6056aa-a1ae-4c34-bca0-dfbeb3e6211c"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"15=8+4+2+1. 按插入顺序逐次合并, B0, B1, B2, B3 的根依次为 96, -18, 15, -7"}]}}},{"path":"versions/d436a541-10dc-42c7-aecd-fcb26c9c3b4f/8392d7da1d538f183cf1a6ed859ac53f68e928899325b2f0697de1db46d19d72.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"d436a541-10dc-42c7-aecd-fcb26c9c3b4f","revision":"sha256:8392d7da1d538f183cf1a6ed859ac53f68e928899325b2f0697de1db46d19d72","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"The number of light nodes along the right path of a skew heap is Ω(log N)."}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"True","correct":false,"option_id":"6e440bd7-8a0c-4b66-b954-17fada1907ae"},{"type":"text","content":"False","correct":true,"option_id":"86f25a00-d367-4000-9cdc-0dbf4dc3d7a6"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"轻结点数量具有 O(log N) 上界. 例如结点沿左孩子形成链时, 根的右路径只有一个结点, 所以 Ω(log N) 的下界有反例"}]}}},{"path":"versions/4b1a2615-6540-44d5-9ff6-29975274b03e/7ff7a7d5ccdad9564af7fa9929972bd104d77fa4664f6561de7c74d4222b7e9c.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"4b1a2615-6540-44d5-9ff6-29975274b03e","revision":"sha256:7ff7a7d5ccdad9564af7fa9929972bd104d77fa4664f6561de7c74d4222b7e9c","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"After deleting 14 from avl tree below, which of the following statements is incorrect?"},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/83046b3bd0efd1704e624a3b24c63a9cea7f2229137777fdbfcc5ec919c77820.png","alt":"单选题 1原题图"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"The subtree rooted at 12 has 3 nodes","correct":false,"option_id":"ed0e177b-a2f9-4c34-be86-d0eb0db6c1ae"},{"type":"text","content":"4 and 10 are brothers","correct":false,"option_id":"9a077980-9524-4910-b8b8-b9b5220bcb7d"},{"type":"text","content":"4 is father of 2","correct":false,"option_id":"38cf9812-5e44-4de6-bd5f-31ec78bcda45"},{"type":"text","content":"The number of nodes which is in the subtree rooted at 4 increases","correct":true,"option_id":"90058a4b-52d9-4214-979a-244818083099"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"删除 14 后先调整以 13 为根的子树, 再调整以 10 为根的子树, 最终根为 8, 左右孩子为 4 和 10. 4 的子树由 9 个结点减少为 7 个, D 错误"}]}}},{"path":"versions/6c718b8f-4140-49ef-8965-9bec44778a34/35f41235234c897e87cd23bd66a0a3d0304ddf3c90bbea3ead2ba471de5da4c7.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"6c718b8f-4140-49ef-8965-9bec44778a34","revision":"sha256:35f41235234c897e87cd23bd66a0a3d0304ddf3c90bbea3ead2ba471de5da4c7","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Given an optimal prefix code for n symbols, which of the following statements are true? (Recall that the average code length is the sum of the code length of all symbols, weighted by their frequencies.)"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"The maximum coding length of a symbol can be n−1","correct":true,"option_id":"3c2a0869-e329-4518-b20b-a673773d8a5f"},{"type":"text","content":"The minimum code length of a symbol can be 1","correct":true,"option_id":"f9162845-92ed-4998-bc09-725ce1aec8d1"},{"type":"text","content":"The average code length can be as large as Θ(n)","correct":false,"option_id":"8568aa5e-61c1-46f0-a3b5-84aa460e1b36"},{"type":"text","content":"The average code length can be as small as O(1)","correct":true,"option_id":"59cae00c-c5cc-473a-ba3d-d04cd1646e5a"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"适当的频率分布可以使 Huffman 树最大码长为 n−1, 最小码长为 1, 平均码长仍有常数上界. 总能构造长度至多 ceil(log₂n) 的定长前缀码, 最优平均码长不会达到 Θ(n)"}]}}},{"path":"versions/38054957-7920-47d8-b5c8-34b8b4566aa7/bafdc0ea22fcf241b542b6de5f0a667d51f27fccc8aff680cfdad684cdc3b3b0.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"38054957-7920-47d8-b5c8-34b8b4566aa7","revision":"sha256:bafdc0ea22fcf241b542b6de5f0a667d51f27fccc8aff680cfdad684cdc3b3b0","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Consider the following symbol frequencies for a five-symbol alphabet. What is the average encoding length of an optimal prefix code?"},{"type":"table","headers":["Symbol","Frequency"],"rows":[["A","0.32"],["B","0.20"],["C","0.20"],["D","0.18"],["E","0.10"]],"align":["left","left"]}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"2.10","correct":false,"option_id":"8786f117-5ff5-44bc-a115-2f4e2e124751"},{"type":"text","content":"2.28","correct":true,"option_id":"f2c5e92c-324f-44ac-bdbd-5b3a42cd8a46"},{"type":"text","content":"2.48","correct":false,"option_id":"19ee4db0-84d4-4dfe-be08-9bbc7cbcf65b"},{"type":"text","content":"3.00","correct":false,"option_id":"26cf7ff6-de74-422e-ba07-339547034d91"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"依次合并 0.10+0.18=0.28, 0.20+0.20=0.40, 0.28+0.32=0.60, 0.40+0.60=1. 各次合并权重之和即加权平均码长, 为 2.28"}]}}},{"path":"versions/bd2d5f02-975c-48b7-8819-c4092a05ecfd/54466c9b2f6230a89a3bea206a1a3aaa2e702dfa335a7660eada011a41242147.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"bd2d5f02-975c-48b7-8819-c4092a05ecfd","revision":"sha256:54466c9b2f6230a89a3bea206a1a3aaa2e702dfa335a7660eada011a41242147","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Consider the following game tree. If node d is pruned by α-β pruning algorithm, which of the following statements about the value of node a or node b must be correct?"},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/e45eb117bde125d09b127dbb470f6db6ac02a7fa7998ae4beb00169027ad95b5.png","alt":"多选题 2原题图"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"at least one of them are less than or equal to 78","correct":true,"option_id":"94650fb7-9103-4be4-b2e6-9b9d5c8491b0"},{"type":"text","content":"at least one of them are greater than or equal to 78","correct":false,"option_id":"4630af27-f507-42fb-917b-00fd9efb5c3f"},{"type":"text","content":"both are less than or equal to 68","correct":false,"option_id":"8ed19b41-5e11-4dfd-8073-e9530df90858"},{"type":"text","content":"both are greater than or equal to 65","correct":false,"option_id":"1b63f940-af0f-44bb-8cfb-22ef5c0b26b9"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"按从左到右搜索, 根的左侧子树值为 max(65, min(a,b)); 右侧 max 结点先得到 78, 要剪掉 d 必须 78 不小于左侧子树值, 等价于 min(a,b)≤78, 所以 A 必然成立"}]}}},{"path":"versions/474c88e1-9276-43e6-8382-20327069261a/98e973166813779956622fa65f1b6d46ba1c086324f55fecbb4ca74322fcff6c.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"474c88e1-9276-43e6-8382-20327069261a","revision":"sha256:98e973166813779956622fa65f1b6d46ba1c086324f55fecbb4ca74322fcff6c","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Gvien the following table, what are the precision and the recall?"},{"type":"table","headers":["","Relevant","Irrelevant"],"rows":[["Retrieved","3000","1000"],["Not Retrieved","21000","7000"]],"align":["left","left","left"]}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"Precision = 75% and Recall = 12.5%","correct":true,"option_id":"3c4a727b-e46e-421f-a46b-37a4730f438f"},{"type":"text","content":"Precision = 12.5% and Recall = 75%","correct":false,"option_id":"4d48c6c6-5d25-4bfe-8041-079f4dc3c35c"},{"type":"text","content":"Precision = 75% and Recall = 87.5%","correct":false,"option_id":"dd326032-06d3-451c-aafe-4fa03b87047a"},{"type":"text","content":"Precision = 87.5% and Recall = 75%","correct":false,"option_id":"e57aa6b9-c2ff-41c1-bcbe-d0d139dc6c26"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"Precision = 3000/(3000+1000) = 75%, Recall = 3000/(3000+21000) = 12.5%"}]}}},{"path":"versions/865640c4-5b20-41a6-b564-3de246e66f29/16fdbbafd75d380a3d86002b59891eb1483428f0b9985068cb5794786e578921.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"865640c4-5b20-41a6-b564-3de246e66f29","revision":"sha256:16fdbbafd75d380a3d86002b59891eb1483428f0b9985068cb5794786e578921","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Which node is root 7's child after splaying 4 in the given splay tree?"},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/a7730342f7de96c865657930379cf66706ec798a190c3866f89e8842c3731d32.png","alt":"单选题 5原题图"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"2","correct":false,"option_id":"6775a8af-460c-4dc3-b88d-a8699e17c43d"},{"type":"text","content":"4","correct":false,"option_id":"92fee9e7-23d4-4361-b9cf-93b5cc01806e"},{"type":"text","content":"5","correct":true,"option_id":"e4b9f87f-1b90-4051-b3fd-88daf6c57407"},{"type":"text","content":"6","correct":false,"option_id":"48f7e3c0-0c2a-429b-bf35-cc957f001891"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"先对结点 4, 5, 2 执行 zig-zag, 再对 4, 7 执行 zig. 最终根为 4, 其右孩子为 7, 7 的左孩子为 5"}]}}},{"path":"versions/453f865e-7169-4ef4-a682-c9de93b21030/e8b12dea775052bf9503de91c119acadd2807a17c862c18ee361b9fb5ef8074b.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"3eb3811b-4425-46ad-8bb6-a0504dca151b","question_id":"453f865e-7169-4ef4-a682-c9de93b21030","revision":"sha256:e8b12dea775052bf9503de91c119acadd2807a17c862c18ee361b9fb5ef8074b","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"Merge the two skew heaps in the following figure. How many of the following statements is/are FALSE?\n\n- the null path length of 8 is the same as that of 6\n- 35 is the right child of 18\n- the depths of 18 and 33 are the same"},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/8f7cff5257da20db1047e2839a32a2e6025ad883fd63bfd9fb58b15a5b0e4b39.png","alt":"单选题 6原题图"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"0","correct":false,"option_id":"c1bebd3c-283e-4472-b0d3-727e80db5a8b"},{"type":"text","content":"1","correct":true,"option_id":"9c6fd5cf-4c66-4283-96db-c2bebe4dd6bd"},{"type":"text","content":"2","correct":false,"option_id":"d1fd3e10-3e46-4628-8f12-55e0d71fdccc"},{"type":"text","content":"3","correct":false,"option_id":"7c2ba262-63fe-4377-9572-5480312197e8"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"按完整右路径规则, 除最大结点外均交换左右孩子, 因此 18 也交换. 合并后 NPL(8)=1、NPL(6)=2, 只有第一项假. 遇空堆直接返回剩余子树的实现可能得到不同结果"}]}}}]}